# Phase — Project Intelligence

## Product
Visual RSI regime EA only — no trading.

## Regime (v1.22 dynamic INV)
- SELL INV = U-turn/bounce ≥65 (resist line follows market until regime ends)
- BUY INV = U-turn/bounce ≤35 (support line follows until regime ends)
- Flip only on INV cross (not fixed 35/65 stick)
- Phase_SR.mqh finds recent swing in zone; aqua=support orange=resist

## Drawing
- Prefix `PH_`
- Modules: `Include/Phase_BuyRegime.mqh`, `Phase_SellRegime.mqh`, `Phase_Regime.mqh`, `Phase_Draw.mqh`
- Bg black; strips/boxes/signals via Phase_Draw
- Boxes: body only (open/close), bull down→up green, bear up→down red

## Companion
`Indicators/Phase_RSI.mq5` — RSI(14), levels 20/35/40/50/60/65/80, zone fills 35–40 & 60–65

## Docs
Phase_PRD.md + memory-bank/ — update on significant changes
